  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global Credit Program for Safeguarding the Productive Fabric and Employment in Bolivia</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa Global de Crdito para la Defensa del Tejido Productivo y el Empleo en Bolivia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general de este proyecto es apoyar la sostenibilidad frente a la crisis del COVID-19, de las MiPyME como sostn del empleo en Bolivia. El objetivo especfico es apoyar la sostenibilidad financiera de corto plazo de las MiPyME.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this operation is to support the sustainability of the Micro, Small and Medium Enterprises (MSME) faced by the crisis of COVID-19 to maintain employment in Bolivia. The specific objective is to support the short-term financial sustainability of MSME.</narrative>
  </description>
